{"meta":{"id":"tt0075314","type":"movie","name":"Taxi Driver","imdb_id":"tt0075314","description":"Para sobrellevar el insomnio crónico que sufre desde su regreso de Vietnam, Travis Bickle (Robert De Niro) trabaja como taxista nocturno en Nueva York. Es un hombre insociable que apenas tiene contacto con los demás, se pasa los días en el cine y vive prendado de Betsy (Cybill Shepherd), una atractiva rubia que trabaja como voluntaria en una campaña política. Pero lo que realmente obsesiona a Travis es comprobar cómo la violencia, la sordidez y la desolación dominan la ciudad. Y un día decide pasar a la acción.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0075314.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9uddYYTNcLWpzUkl5iw1RUYhLhY.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nfO5weKIHhHqwYvXzMelRSeH799.png","genres":["Crimen","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"1976","released":"1976-02-09T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"114 min","imdbRating":"8.2","country":"United States of America","cast":["Robert De Niro","Jodie Foster","Cybill Shepherd","Harvey Keitel","Peter Boyle","Leonard Harris","Albert Brooks","Diahnne Abbott","Frank Adu","Victor Argo","Gino Ardito","Garth Avery","Harry Cohn","Cooper Cunningham","Brenda Dickson","Harry Fischler","Nat Grant","Richard Higgs","Beau Kayser","Victor Magnotta","Bob Maroff","Norman Matlock","Bill Minkin","Murray Moston","Harry Northup","Gene Palma","Harlan Cary Poe","Steven Prince","Peter Savage","Martin Scorsese"],"director":["Martin Scorsese"],"writer":["Paul Schrader"],"trailers":[{"source":"zdqCqDSTVNI","type":"Trailer","name":"Modern Trailer","ytId":"zdqCqDSTVNI","lang":"en"},{"source":"S7ORyD-e7-0","type":"Trailer","name":"Official 40th Anniversary Reissue Trailer","ytId":"S7ORyD-e7-0","lang":"en"},{"source":"UUxD4-dEzn0","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer","ytId":"UUxD4-dEzn0","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"zdqCqDSTVNI","title":"Modern Trailer"},{"ytId":"S7OR